%% HTTP prefix: /api/v1. API lane includes verified middleware and errorHandler.
%% Grouped read and validation calls short-circuit on error. No Repository layer is implied.
%% Coach uses the per-session coach-change flow instead of this endpoint.
sequenceDiagram
    actor A as Receptionist
    participant UI as API client
    participant API as Express API middleware
    participant S as requestersService
    participant DB as Prisma / PostgreSQL

    A->>UI: Submit leave interval and reason
    UI->>API: POST /api/v1/leave-requests
    activate API
    API->>API: authenticate, checkFacilityScope, authorizeExact(RECEPTIONIST), validate request
    alt request guard rejects
        API-->>UI: 400 / 401 / 403 error
    else request accepted
        API->>S: createStaffLeave(user, input)
        activate S
        S->>S: Read requestContext and validate role, reason and interval
        S->>S: Require Receptionist, end after start and reason length 3 to 1000
        alt wrong role or invalid interval / reason
            S-->>API: 400 / 403
        else business conditions satisfied
            S->>DB: Transaction creates LeaveRequest and notification outbox rows for Managers
            activate DB
            DB-->>S: Saved result
            deactivate DB
            S->>S: Flush notification outbox after persistence
            S-->>API: Pending staff leave
        end
        deactivate S
        API-->>UI: 200 result or mapped error
    end
    deactivate API
    UI-->>A: Show result or actionable error
%% UI_SCOPE: Backend/API implemented. Current application UI route is not verified as reachable.

